# Scenario "first-task" (US, milestone 8, playable game with replayed inputs): a new game played past the end of the
# birthday cutscene, through the first task the guide gives (fetch the flower from the vase on the party table), up to the
# Chibi-Copter tutorial. Fresh user folder, native memory card (the game creates its save as in "new-game").
# Inputs written by hand from screenshots of native runs (cycle clock, RTC 800000000), no game data here.
# Route: A every 30 frames from the first dialogue to frame 9150 (advances every dialogue box); on the table, stick
# down-left then down to the stacked plates, a running jump (stick + A) onto them, a running jump up-right onto the
# vase, stick up to climb it: reaching the top starts the cutscene where Chibi-Robo pulls out the flower; A every 30
# frames again through the Equip screen tutorial (Chibi-Copter). Ends with Chibi-Robo in control on the vase.
# Not run by tools/ab.py (progression scenario, see play/README.md); run it with tools/run.py --scenario <this file>.
# Notes: A pressed with the stick at rest does nothing here (no jump); next to the guide it talks to him instead.
# Recorded on GGTE01; the PAL version of the same route is play/GGTP01/first-task.scn.
name first-task
description New game, birthday cutscene, first task (flower on the party table), Chibi-Copter tutorial (US).
version GGTE01
